# Figma sources for the hero background. The page only ever loads the .webp derived
# from these; together they are ~6MB of files nothing references.
hero_bg*.png
# Local rollback copies of assets replaced during a session.
superseded-*/
# Whole-file rollbacks kept beside a page while an experiment is live.
*.rollback-*

# WebM trial. Converting the phone-mockup videos to WebM was meant to give transparent
# corners as well as smaller files. The size win is real (283KB vs 447KB) but the alpha
# is not: these encode as yuv420p, and a conversion cannot invent transparency the MP4
# source never had. Needs a WebM-with-alpha export straight out of Figma to be worth it.
*.webm
